  "_citation": "ISO 286-2:2010 + ISO 286-1:2010",
  "_notes": [
    "IT grades IT4-IT12 are the tabulated standard tolerance values of ISO 286-1:2010 Table 1 (um), by nominal size range. source.kind='table'. The tabulated values are NOT reproducible by rounding multiplier*i: the standard rounds them by its own rules.",
    "Fundamental deviation data and ISO 286 correction rules are maintained in services/research/fits.py.",
    "D_mean convention: for range [lo, hi], D = sqrt(lo*hi) except 1-3 where D = sqrt(1*3) = 1.732 mm.",
    "All deviations in micrometres (um). Sign convention: positive = above nominal, negative = below nominal.",
    "Ranges use ISO 286 'over X up to and including Y' convention (e.g. 50mm falls in 30-50 range, not 50-80)."
  ],

